{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After dying in traffic, you wake up in a world where magic has vanished\u2026 but not for you. Explore a shattered land in this isekai Metroidvania, mastering fluid movement, battling monsters, clashing with Outworlders, and uncovering the truth in a short but rich adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies that hinder your progress and take what they leave behind to grow stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501850/extras/combat_gif3.gif?t=1745484140\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use abilities you gain to explore new places and find secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501850/extras/exploration_gif3.gif?t=1745484140\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a grueling day of work wondering why he even bothers anymore, a chance encounter leads to Jake waking up in a laboratory in an unfamiliar world encased in a suit of armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something went wrong with his transfer into the new world and his critical condition was stabilized by an affable genius who seems to be from another world herself. She wants to help Jake gain power and look into something for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The native inhabitants of the world are in turmoil due to recently losing access to magic. The loss seems to have happened around the same time Jake crossed over from Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jake's savior, Zara, seems to know more about what happened than she's letting on. Can she really be trusted?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501850/extras/Zara_portrait2.png?t=1745484140\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501850?t=1745484140","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501850?t=1745484140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501850/bc18058a4f3af643dd526698698163e7a3182f57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745484140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501850/bc18058a4f3af643dd526698698163e7a3182f57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745484140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After dying in traffic, you wake up in a world where magic has vanished\u2026 but not for you. Explore a shattered land in this isekai Metroidvania, mastering fluid movement, battling monsters, clashing with Outworlders, and uncovering the truth in a short but rich adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies that hinder your progress and take what they leave behind to grow stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501850/extras/combat_gif3.gif?t=1745484140\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use abilities you gain to explore new places and find secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501850/extras/exploration_gif3.gif?t=1745484140\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a grueling day of work wondering why he even bothers anymore, a chance encounter leads to Jake waking up in a laboratory in an unfamiliar world encased in a suit of armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something went wrong with his transfer into the new world and his critical condition was stabilized by an affable genius who seems to be from another world herself. She wants to help Jake gain power and look into something for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The native inhabitants of the world are in turmoil due to recently losing access to magic. The loss seems to have happened around the same time Jake crossed over from Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jake's savior, Zara, seems to know more about what happened than she's letting on. Can she really be trusted?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501850/extras/Zara_portrait2.png?t=1745484140\" /></p>","developers":["Outworlder LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501850/d8556334690d2d49812b16fd6c12a013392cd252/header.jpg?t=1745484140","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128053,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128053/movie480.mp4?t=1745167449","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128053/movie_max.mp4?t=1745167449"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128053/58af762db609876193017b48048cce1c3854acac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745167449","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128053/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745167449","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128053/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745167449"}}],"name":"Echoes of the Outworlder","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimu